# Copy to .env (git-ignored) and fill in. Never commit .env or paste the token into any chat.
# 1) https://discord.com/developers/applications -> New Application "Pill" -> Bot -> Reset Token -> paste below.
#    Same page: turn ON "Message Content Intent" -> Save.
# 2) OAuth2 -> URL Generator: scope "bot"; permissions: View Channels, Manage Channels, Send Messages,
#    Read Message History, Add Reactions, Attach Files, Embed Links. Open the URL, pick your server, Authorize.
# 3) Start the bridge once: it creates the PILL category and its channels by itself.
DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN=
DISCORD_CATEGORY=PILL
HERDR_TARGET=wZ:p1
